&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:22.5pt;min-height:22.5pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:9pt;"&gt;コンテンツ事業(千円)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:right;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:9pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;5,064,540&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-right:9pt;"&gt;91.5&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:22.5pt;min-height:22.5pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;合計(千円)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:right;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:9pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;5,064,540&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-right:9pt;"&gt;91.5&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;(注) １．当社は、報告セグメントが単一のセグメントであります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;２．最近２事業年度の主な相手先別の売上高及び当該売上高の総売上高に対する割合は、次のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:0pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:480pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
